          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "14. Accordingly, the present criminal revision petition stands allowed by interfering with the sentence of Simple Imprisonment for 6 (six) months in respect of petitioner No. 1 and it is directed that the sentence be confined to the fine al"
